    V4 norm ratio |g|/|gx| = 0.7879   (sinc(R) = 0.9411 is the predicted attenuation)

  The test: does V4 keep circuits << parameter-shift while bringing total
  cx BELOW 1.0x and depth back to a small multiple of the ansatz? If so the
  QPE ladder was a cost with no matching benefit at these G, and V4 is the
  version of this method that can actually run on hardware.
