========================================================================================================
GROWTH EXPONENTS   cost ~ N^alpha   (smaller wins asymptotically)
========================================================================================================
  method                  circuits     depth    total 2q    build ms
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  parameter-shift             1.00      0.44        2.20        1.29
  QLTO V3 (QPE)              -0.00      1.27        1.26        0.61
  QLTO V4 (direct)           -0.00      0.29        1.06        0.56

  Heisenberg holds G=3 at every N, so this sweep CANNOT separate QPE's
  G-independence from V4's G-linearity. That takes a family whose group
  count grows:
    H2     2 qubits,    5 terms -> G =   2   parameter-shift    32 circuits, V4   12, V3   8
    LiH    4 qubits,   15 terms -> G =   3   parameter-shift    96 circuits, V4   16, V3   8
